<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="Sylwithe" data-copy-zh="Sylwithe">Sylwithe</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Find the Hollow, plan crystal upgrades and check New Game+ requirements." data-copy-zh="找到幽谷，安排水晶升级并查看新游戏+条件。">Find the Hollow, plan crystal upgrades and check New Game+ requirements.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">去哪里找</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">卡住时检查什么</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Crystal_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Tempest_Strike_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Talk_and_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Sylwithe — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sylwithe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Sylwithe — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sylwithe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Sylwithe — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Sylwithe offers crystal equipment upgrades, accessories, an advanced combat lesson and New Game+. His shop does not require a high relationship stage.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Location_and_Availability"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><p>From Whispering Woods, take Darkened Path for 5 minutes, then Sylwithe's Hollow for another 5. The second entrance has its own content-access lock. At Sylwithe's Hollow, his portrait is available all day.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Talk at your own pace; neither the shop nor Tempest Strike needs a high affection stage. The lesson’s stat and resource requirements are below.</p><p>Tempest Strike improves Stormslash; it does not teach Stormslash or create a new attack by itself. Learn Stormslash separately before expecting the combat effect.</p><p>New Game+ (Beta) becomes available on day 20 of the current timeline. Its confirmation spends 5 Crystals and starts a new timeline. Read the New Game+ guide and make a manual save before confirming; previewing or declining does not spend the fee.</p></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / start window</th><th scope="col">Cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">New Game+ (Beta)</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">current timeline day 20 or later; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">0 min; 5 Crystals</td><td data-label="Reward / limit"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Talk to Sylwithe</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">+1 base affection; 7/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Tempest Strike</th><td data-label="Requirements / start window">Stranger (0); Mystic 60; content access indicated by the lock</td><td data-label="Cost / recovery">350 min; $10,000,000; 5 Crystals; 180 Energy; 100 Calm</td><td data-label="Reward / limit">learn Tempest Strike once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The location shop upgrades melee weapon, armor or ranged weapon by one stored level for 10 Crystals, up to level 10, at 0 minutes. Its accessories and their equipment rules are listed in the Hollow guide.</p><p>After buying Proficiency Upgrade from Seraph or Lillian, the separate Master Equipment upgrades cost 10 Crystals per level, take 0 minutes and stop at level 10. They require the corresponding content access and the immediately preceding equipment level.</p><p>Start times are shown; the ending hour is excluded. Base affection receives the relationship bonuses, while direct affection is added as listed. Ordinary affection, player Erotic Experience and NPC intimacy experience are separate.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Order_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Entering Darkened Path does not prove that the separate Hollow entrance is unlocked; inspect its own lock.</li><li>For Tempest Strike check Mystic 60, 5 Crystals, $10,000,000 and the full Energy/Calm cost, not affection.</li><li>For Master Equipment check the purchased Proficiency Upgrade and current stored level.</li><li>The New Game+ day requirement uses the current timeline, not total days across earlier runs.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe's Hollow shop</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">New Game+</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">Combat</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">Other equipment upgrades</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">Skills</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Credits_and_Current_Scope"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Crystal_Shop"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Tempest_Strike_Lesson"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Talk_and_Affection"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Sylwithe 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sylwithe.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Sylwithe 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/sylwithe.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Sylwithe 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Sylwithe提供水晶装备升级、配件、进阶战斗课程与新游戏+。商店不要求高关系阶段。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Location_and_Availability"></span><h2>去哪里找</h2><p>从低语森林选择幽暗小径，花费5分钟，再选择Sylwithe的幽谷，另花5分钟。第二段入口有独立内容权限要求；进入Sylwithe的幽谷后，他的头像全天出现。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>可按自己的节奏交谈。商店与暴风打击都不要求高好感，课程只需满足下表属性和资源条件。</p><p>暴风打击强化的是风暴斩，不会同时教授风暴斩，也不会单独新增攻击按钮；先学会风暴斩才能在战斗中使用效果。</p><p>新游戏+（测试版）要求当前时间线达到第20天。确认后才会消耗5水晶，开始新时间线。操作前先阅读新游戏+指南并手动存档；查看预览或拒绝不会扣费。</p></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／开始时段</th><th scope="col">消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">新游戏+（测试版）</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">当前时间线第20天或以后；陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">0分钟；水晶×5</td><td data-label="奖励／次数"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">和 Sylwithe 交谈</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">15分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">基础好感+1；每天7次</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">暴风打击</th><td data-label="条件／开始时段">陌生人（0）；神秘60；满足锁形提示所示的内容权限</td><td data-label="消耗／恢复">350分钟；$10,000,000；水晶×5；180精力；100镇定</td><td data-label="奖励／次数">学习暴风打击，仅一次</td></tr></tbody></table><p>地点商店可花10水晶，将近战武器、护甲或远程武器的储存等级提升1级，最高10级，不消耗时间。配件与装备方式见专门指南。</p><p>向Seraph或Lillian购买熟练度升级后，还可使用独立的大师装备升级，每级10水晶，不消耗时间，最高10级，要求对应内容权限及紧邻的前一级装备。</p><p>表中均为开始时间，不包含结束整点。基础好感受关系加成影响，直接好感按所列数值增加。普通好感、玩家情趣经验和NPC亲密经验分别计算。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Order_and_Troubleshooting"></span><h2>卡住时检查什么</h2><ul><li>能到幽暗小径不代表已解锁后续洞穴入口，需查看第二段入口的锁形提示。</li><li>暴风打击需检查神秘60、5水晶、$10,000,000与完整精力、镇定消耗，不必刷好感。</li><li>大师装备需先购买熟练度升级，并检查当前储存等级。</li><li>新游戏+按本条时间线天数判断，不累计之前周目的天数。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="game-systems-sylwithes-hollow.html">Sylwithe的幽谷商店</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-new-game-plus.html">新游戏+</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-combat-system.html">战斗</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-blacksmith-and-forge.html">其他装备升级</a></li><li><a href="skills.html">技能</a></li></ul></section>
